{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"1395","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"C. Boboniu and Bit Operations"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"1 second"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Boboniu likes bit operations. He wants to play a game with you."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Boboniu gives you two sequences of non-negative integers $$$a_1,a_2,\\ldots,a_n$$$ and $$$b_1,b_2,\\ldots,b_m$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For each $$$i$$$ ($$$1\\le i\\le n$$$), you're asked to choose a $$$j$$$ ($$$1\\le j\\le m$$$) and let $$$c_i=a_i\\& b_j$$$, where $$$\\&$$$ denotes the "},{"attrs":{"href":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bitwise_operation#AND"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"bitwise AND operation"}],"kind":"link"},{"kind":"text","text":". Note that you can pick the same $$$j$$$ for different $$$i$$$'s."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Find the minimum possible $$$c_1 | c_2 | \\ldots | c_n$$$, where $$$|$$$ denotes the "},{"attrs":{"href":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bitwise_operation#AND"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"bitwise OR operation"}],"kind":"link"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line contains two integers $$$n$$$ and $$$m$$$ ($$$1\\le n,m\\le 200$$$)."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The next line contains $$$n$$$ integers $$$a_1,a_2,\\ldots,a_n$$$ ($$$0\\le a_i \\lt 2^9$$$)."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The next line contains $$$m$$$ integers $$$b_1,b_2,\\ldots,b_m$$$ ($$$0\\le b_i \\lt 2^9$$$)."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Print one integer: the minimum possible $$$c_1 | c_2 | \\ldots | c_n$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n4 2\n2 6 4 0\n2 4\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n2"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n7 6\n1 9 1 9 8 1 0\n1 1 4 5 1 4\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n0"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n8 5\n179 261 432 162 82 43 10 38\n379 357 202 184 197\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n147"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For the first example, we have $$$c_1=a_1\\& b_2=0$$$, $$$c_2=a_2\\& b_1=2$$$, $$$c_3=a_3\\& b_1=0$$$, $$$c_4 = a_4\\& b_1=0$$$.Thus $$$c_1 | c_2 | c_3 |c_4 =2$$$, and this is the minimal answer we can get."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"C","problemCode":"1395C","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/1395/problem/C"}